    "preamble": "R.Kodikesavan vs The State Through The on 14 March, 2024 Author: M.Dhandapani Bench: M.Dhandapani Crl.O.P.(MD)No.14 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 14.03.2024 Coram: The Honourable Mr.Justice M.Dhandapani Crl.O.P.(MD) No.14617 of 2022 and Crl.M.P(MD).Nos.9473 and 9475 of 2022 1.R.Kodikesavan 2.P.Rajan ... Vs. 1.The State through the Food Safety Officer, Tuticorin Corporation Zone-II, Tuticorin District. 2.Kali Muthu ...Res Prayer: Criminal Original Petition is filed under Section 482 of Cr.P.C, to call for the records in C.C.No.195/2021 pending before t learned Judicial Magistrate No.II, Tuticorin, Tuticorin District an the same. For petitioners : No-appearance For R1 : Mr.P.Kottaichamy Government Advocate (Crl https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/3 Crl.O.P.(MD)No.14 Order R.Kodikesavan vs The State Through The on 14 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/90616017/ 1 When the matter was taken up for hearing on 07.03.2024, there was no representation for the petitioners. Hence, the matter was directed to be listed under the caption for dismissal today. Today also, there is no representation for the petitioners.",
